{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20218","headline":"吊房十五次卿少府 · 孟郊","name":"吊房十五次卿少府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日高方得起，独赏些些春。\n可惜宛转鸎，好音与佗人。\n昔年此气味，还走曲江滨。\n逢着韩退之，结交方殷勤。\n蜀客骨目高，聪辩劒戟新。\n如何昨日欢，今日见无因。\n英奇一谢世，视听一爲尘。\n谁言老泪短，泪短沾衣巾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20218.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20218","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}